{"name": "Astral Hunter: Homebound", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/c9ca39f59b9515b5a2c4eb6ae1b0e5a7.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>Hello, Stellar Hunters! We are Taimao Games, an indie development team of two. We are delighted to bring you Astral Hunter: Homebound, a fast\u2011paced action roguelike game.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"67\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/826b517a5b1f567800fc41e1bb4f4a00.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"557\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/826b517a5b1f567800fc41e1bb4f4a00.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/44ec8418ddf0c87eccf1bab9b575d784.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/44ec8418ddf0c87eccf1bab9b575d784.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/44ec8418ddf0c87eccf1bab9b575d784.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><strong>Pick up your weapon and face hordes of enemies. Continuously upgrade and modify your gear or skills during combat. Cleverly buy special items and actively sacrifice stats that do not benefit you \u2014 play to your strengths and avoid your weaknesses, forging a combat style that is uniquely yours.</strong><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/966e441cff259f85984b47bd25e0b659.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"558\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/966e441cff259f85984b47bd25e0b659.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/966e441cff259f85984b47bd25e0b659.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/62e2e3b117c95bc21d2024987694a60d.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/62e2e3b117c95bc21d2024987694a60d.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/62e2e3b117c95bc21d2024987694a60d.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><strong>Capture all kinds of creatures you encounter in battle and use their abilities to aid you. Filter for quality, keeping only the very best! Bring them back to your base, build a ranch, and let these creatures continuously produce precious materials for you. (Idle production is supported!)</strong><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"68\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/69e635de17e816c74b3002d6a2b5b463.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"576\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/69e635de17e816c74b3002d6a2b5b463.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/69e635de17e816c74b3002d6a2b5b463.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/dd98a3e94663634f53c6f222e4249660.poster.avif?t=1785919999\" width=\"614\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/dd98a3e94663634f53c6f222e4249660.webm?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/dd98a3e94663634f53c6f222e4249660.mp4?t=1785919999\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><strong>Use the resources produced by your ranch pets to strengthen yourself. Absorb the essence of all things, transforming from the inside out \u2014 each sip is a leap toward a stronger form.</strong> </div>", "short_desc": "This is a top-down action RogueLite game where you fight hordes of alien creatures with your chosen weapons. Build a unique combat style using various upgrades and items. Capture creatures to use their abilities or harvest materials. Recruit more characters and conquer the planet!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35